Cell["\<\
S has the same shape as V and describes overlap across the device\[Dash]lead \
interface.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1511570034,ExpressionUUID->"8aa48c8f-56df-9a42-9228-9e7159c23e44"],

Cell["\<\
The left coupling becomes V - z S; the right coupling is \
ConjugateTranspose[V] - z ConjugateTranspose[S], which is generally not its \
conjugate transpose at complex z.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->155212672,ExpressionUUID->"9875ddd2-1f92-3444-b4c2-bf77231e36c5"],

Cell["\<\
This wrapper defaults to mode 1, whereas Sigma defaults to mode 3.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1546474249,ExpressionUUID->"71ade193-8abb-0645-b7a6-06c6b04b8fbe"]
}, Closed]],

